; BIND zone file for petrenko.sh -> GitHub Pages (alex-petrenko.github.io).
; Import in Cloudflare: DNS -> Records -> Import, with "Proxy imported DNS records" UNCHECKED
; (GitHub must see these records unproxied to issue the HTTPS certificate).
; GitHub Pages IPs: https://docs.github.com/en/pages/configuring-a-custom-domain-for-your-github-pages-site
$ORIGIN petrenko.sh.
$TTL 3600

@    IN  A      185.199.108.153
@    IN  A      185.199.109.153
@    IN  A      185.199.110.153
@    IN  A      185.199.111.153
@    IN  AAAA   2606:50c0:8000::153
@    IN  AAAA   2606:50c0:8001::153
@    IN  AAAA   2606:50c0:8002::153
@    IN  AAAA   2606:50c0:8003::153
www  IN  CNAME  alex-petrenko.github.io.
